---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <section class="hero container prose">
    <h1>About K8s Practice Lab</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      A free learning platform for <strong>containers and Kubernetes fundamentals</strong> —
      entirely in your browser. No installs. No cloud cluster required.
    </p>

    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Learn</strong> — 7 modules from Docker concepts to production patterns</li>
      <li><strong>Practice</strong> — simulated kubectl with realistic cluster states</li>
      <li><strong>Quiz</strong> — check understanding after each module</li>
      <li><strong>Progress</strong> — saved locally in your browser</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Simulation vs real clusters</h2>
    <p>
      This site teaches you <em>what</em> commands do and <em>why</em> — so when you deploy to a real
      cluster (locally or in the cloud), you already understand Pods, Deployments, Services, and debugging.
    </p>

    <h2>Built in public</h2>
    <p>
      Open source on <a href="https://github.com/Jacob-Idolor/Pet_Projects">GitHub</a>.
      Fork it, host your own copy on AWS (~$1–5/mo), improve it, share it.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
